    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Get ready for an exciting 24-hour hackathon experience at SPECTRUM 1.0, organized by the Department of Computer Science and Engineering (AI &amp; ML) and Computer Science and Engineering (Data Science) at Guru Nanak Dev Engineering College, Bidar.</p>\n<p>SPECTRUM 1.0 brings together passionate innovators, developers, and problem-solvers to collaborate, build innovative solutions, and showcase their technical skills.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Event: SPECTRUM 1.0 &ndash; 24 Hour Hackathon</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Dates: 9th &amp; 10th December</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Duration: 24 Hours</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Venue: Guru Nanak Dev Engineering College, Bidar</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Prize Pool: ₹40,000</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>24 hours of innovation and problem-solving.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>An opportunity to showcase your technical and creative abilities.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Collaboration and teamwork.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>A competitive platform to develop innovative solutions.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Exciting prizes worth ₹40,000.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Who Can Participate?</strong></p>\n<p>Students interested in technology, coding, innovation, and problem-solving are encouraged to participate.</p>\n<p><strong>Registration</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Register through the provided registration link and be part of SPECTRUM 1.0.</div>\n<div><a title=\"Registration Link\" href=\"https://spectrum10.vercel.app/\">https://spectrum10.vercel.app/</a></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Build. Innovate. Collaborate. Solve.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Accommodation Notice</strong></p>\n<p>accommodation or overnight stay will be informed shortly. However, resting facilities will be available for hackathon participants during the event.</p>",
